It must not call into question the motives of the accurator.
It must remain calm and serene."
Fleischer seemed to compare Waters’s reaction to Democrats’ critics of Judge Kavanaugh, accused of appearing too angered at Thursday’s hearing.
Omar Navarro, a Republican nominee at Waters headquarters in the mid-term election, also shared his thoughts on Twitter.
"If it's true, it's huge," he tweeted.
In its statement, Waters stated that its office had alerted “the law enforcement authorities concerned” about these fraudulent statements.
“We will ensure that the culprits are unmasked,” she added, “while they are held responsible for all their destructive and dangerous acts for all members of my team.”
